OL,4,B'Right time' for Smith exit - but      
OL,5,BMurray not ready for role              
OL,6,GGreat Britain's Davis Cup-winning      
OL,7,Gcaptain Leon Smith says it is the      
OL,8,G"right time" to leave the role after   
OL,9,Galmost 17 years - although Andy Murray 
OL,10,Gis not ready to replace him.           
OL,12,FSmith was appointed in 2010 and guided 
OL,13,Fthe British men's team to Davis Cup    
OL,14,Fvictory in 2015 - the nation's first   
OL,15,Fwin in the event since 1936.           
OL,17,FThe 50-year-old Scot's successor has   
OL,18,Fnot yet been appointed, but the Lawn   
OL,19,FTennis Association (LTA) has spoken to 
OL,20,Fpotential candidates and hopes to      
OL,21,Fannounce the new captain as soon as    
OL,22,Fpossible.                              
